{"id":"vod_sn_36705","vodId":"36705","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"多田君不恋爱","name_cn":"多田君不恋爱","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/7a66ff54b16a56deea8794bd1476c6a2.jpg"},"summary":"多田光良（中村悠一 配音）是一位平凡的高中二年级学生，祖父经营着一间和他同名的咖啡店。多田的梦想是能够成为一名摄影师，因为这是他已故的父亲的职业，多田希望自己有朝一日能够继承父亲的衣钵。一次偶然之中，多田在街上邂逅了名为特蕾莎（石见舞菜香 配音），特蕾莎是一位金发碧眼的德国女孩，来到日本留学。　　多田帮助了迷了路又与同伴走散的特蕾莎，并将她带到了祖父的咖啡店中，令特蕾莎对他产生了深刻的印象。之后，特蕾莎成为了多田的同班同学，并结识了个性大大咧咧十分喧闹的伊集院薰（宫野真守 配音）、脑袋里不知道在想些什么的杉本一（梅原裕一郎 配音）等人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tVwWvx05at1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/314Yk56qMW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WkHiHtKija1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QMpjcP7nbZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1nfGWper6q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RkBwbS3MTq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2RCbjGPPdf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/deCUxPpDX71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7XsvtqU06T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/13equDRRkT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ykNLVTcnQ71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z2HiHQ0SyM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KaKMqNNjkw1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:19.839Z"}